    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have received additional training in the use of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cortosis Gauntlets\">Cortosis Gauntlets</a>. You can use the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b> Talent, even when not armed with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, provided you are wearing a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlet\" title=\"Cortosis Gauntlet\">Cortosis Gauntlet</a>. If you successfully <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b> an attack with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> while wearing a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlet\" title=\"Cortosis Gauntlet\">Cortosis Gauntlet</a>, the attacking <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> is deactivated.",
